        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"599027\">@Leni Aniva</span> and I will be performing at the FARM 2026 performance at ICFP! The performance is free and open to the public - it will be on Monday 8/24 7-9pm at Hine Hall (might be subject to change; check FARM 2026 program closer to performance date) at IU Indianapolis! We'll be playing compositions in Lean.</p>\n<p>FARM 2026 program can be accessed here <a href=\"https://icfp26.sigplan.org/home/farm-2026#program\">https://icfp26.sigplan.org/home/farm-2026#program</a></p>",
